# Auth, accounts & APIs

## Auth (no users table)
- Identity from Cognito `sub` + `email` at request time — `lib/auth/verify.ts` (JWKS/`jose`), `lib/auth/session.ts` (`fuel_id` / `fuel_refresh` cookies)
- OAuth callback: `app/api/auth/callback/route.ts` · Env: `COGNITO_*`, `APP_URL`, `STAGE`

## Accounts
- `lib/accounts.ts` — `getActiveAccountForUser`, membership roles `owner | admin | member`
- Never trust client for domain/identity on onboard/claim — derive from session email

## Integrations
- `lib/integrations.ts` — OAuth for hubspot/granola/slack/email; encrypted credentials in jsonb
- HubSpot: webhook + `api/cron/reconcile-hubspot` → `pipeline_companies`

## Agent + MCP
- Skills: `lib/agent/skills/*` — Zod input, `execute(input, { userEmail, accountId })`; register in `skills/index.ts`
- MCP: `app/api/mcp/route.ts` — bearer `fuel_…` tokens (sha256 in `mcp_api_tokens`); fresh server per request; **no auto rotation**
